        "content": "<div style=\"font:13px/1.5 -apple-system,Segoe UI,Roboto,sans-serif;color:#c7d0d9\"><a href=\"/d/cvt-clusterminder-inventory/x\" style=\"display:block;background:#181b1f;border:1px solid #2c3235;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-decoration:none;\"><b style=\"color:#6cc2ff\">ClusterMinder \u2014 Fleet Inventory &amp; Telemetry Coverage</b><br><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Owns: trays / GPUs / racks / SUs reporting, coverage per SU and per rack, the tray roster, uptime and reboots.</span></a><a href=\"/d/cvt-clusterminder-config/x\" style=\"display:block;background:#181b1f;border:1px solid #2c3235;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-decoration:none;\"><b style=\"color:#6cc2ff\">ClusterMinder \u2014 Firmware &amp; Config Alignment</b><br><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Owns: tray BIOS / kernel / OS baseline, switch firmware version spread, switch roster.</span></a><a href=\"/d/cvt-cable-validation/x\" style=\"display:block;background:#181b1f;border:1px solid #2c3235;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-decoration:none;\"><b style=\"color:#6cc2ff\">CVT \u2014 Cable &amp; Layer-1 Validation vs Golden P2P</b><br><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Owns: as-built switch estate compared against the CVT v3 golden P2P design, plane by plane. Also holds the InfiniBand and Ethernet cable-audit panels, retained for when those exporters are restarted.</span></a><a href=\"/d/gpu-health/x\" style=\"display:block;background:#181b1f;border:1px solid #2c3235;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-decoration:none;\"><b style=\"color:#6cc2ff\">GPU Health</b><br><span style=\"color:#8e8e8e\">Owns: DCGM temperature, power, clocks, XID and ECC.</span></a><a href=\"/d/nvis-node-deep-dive/x\" style=\"display:block;background:#181b1f;border:1px solid #2c3235;border-radius:3px;padding:12px 14px;margin:0 0 8px 0;text-decoration:none;\"><b style=\"color:#6cc2ff\">Node Deep Dive</b><br><span style=\"